ontent__haI0H"><div class="js-snippet-clipboard-copy-unpositioned ChatMessage-module__messageArea__mDCMv"><h3 class="sr-only MarkdownRenderer-module__accessibleHeader__pNAp5">Copilot said: Yes. The current page needs a small</h3><div class="markdown-body MarkdownRenderer-module__container__sJ8jf MarkdownViewer-module__markdownOverrides__sSQCQ copilot-chat-compact-tables" data-copilot-markdown="true" style="--MarkdownRenderer_streaming-fade-duration: 750ms;"><p>Yes. The current page needs a small backend to:</p>
<ul>
<li node="[object Object]">Count page views</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Store table reservations</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Accept birthday, kitty-party, and small-party bookings</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Notify restaurant executives through WhatsApp</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Keep booking records in a database</li>
</ul>
<p>Below is a simple <strong>Node.js + Express + SQLite</strong> implementation.</p>
