</code></pre></div></figure>
<p>The booking data will be stored in <code node="[object Object]">cafe.db</code>.</p>
<p>The executive will receive a WhatsApp message containing:</p>
<ul>
<li node="[object Object]">Booking type</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Customer name</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Phone number</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Date and time</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Guest count</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Indoor/outdoor preference</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Special requests</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Booking ID</li>
</ul>
<p>For production, the admin endpoint should be protected with a login, and the WhatsApp number should be stored as an environment variable:</p>
<figure class="CodeBlock-module__container___ry3V CodeBlock-module__immersive__Gmg6o" aria-labelledby="_r_89_"><div class="CodeBlock-module__header__tJzrz"><span class="LanguageDot-module__languageDot__WZEoH"></span><span id="_r_89_" class="CodeBlock-module__languageName__iQIeg">bash</span><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="medium" data-variant="invisible" aria-labelledby="_r_8a_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-wrap" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align: text-bottom;"><path d="M1.75 7a.747.747 0 0 0-.53.22.747.747 0 0 0 0 1.06c.14.141.331.22.53.22h10c.464 0 .909.184 1.237.513a1.746 1.746 0 0 1 0 2.474A1.746 1.746 0 0 1 11.75 12h-1.464v-.464a.675.675 0 0 0-.375-.607.687.687 0 0 0-.711.064l-1.619 1.214a.679.679 0 0 0 0 1.086L9.2 14.507a.683.683 0 0 0 .711.064.685.685 0 0 0 .375-.607V13.5h1.464A3.247 3.247 0 0 0 15 10.25 3.247 3.247 0 0 0 11.75 7h-10ZM1 2.75c0-.199.079-.39.22-.53A.747.747 0 0 1 1.75 2h12.5c.199 0 .39.079.53.22a.747.747 0 0 1 0 1.06.747.747 0 0 1-.53.22H1.75a.747.747 0 0 1-.53-.22.747.747 0 0 1-.22-.53ZM1.75 12h3.5c.199 0 .39.079.53.22a.747.747 0 0 1 0 1.06.747.747 0 0 1-.53.22h-3.5a.747.747 0 0 1-.53-.22.747.747 0 0 1 0-1.06.747.747 0 0 1 .53-.22Z"></path></svg></button><span class="prc-TooltipV2-Tooltip-tLeuB" data-direction="s" data-component="Tooltip" aria-hidden="true" id="_r_8a_" popover="auto">Wrap</span></div><div class="CodeBlock-module__copyContainer__eNjNy"><div class="CodeBlock-module__copyContent__qV51h"><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk CodeBlock-module__copyButton__buwCD prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="medium" data-variant="invisible" aria-labelledby="_r_8c_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-copy" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align: text-bottom;"><path d="M0 6.75C0 5.784.784 5 1.75 5h1.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-1.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-1.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v1.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 16h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 14.25Z"></path><path d="M5 1.75C5 .784 5.784 0 6.75 0h7.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 11h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 5 9.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Z"></path></svg></button><span class="CopyToClipboardIconButton-module__tooltip__WyiwL prc-TooltipV2-Tooltip-tLeuB" data-direction="s" data-component="Tooltip" aria-label="Copy code" aria-hidden="true" id="_r_8c_" popover="auto">Copy code</span></div></div><div class="CodeBlock-module__codeContainer___2Otq"><pre class="CodeBlock-module__code__N23o9" tabindex="0"><code class="">EXECUTIVE_WHATSAPP=919795555535 npm start
