<p>This adds:</p>
<ul>
<li node="[object Object]">Customer name</li>
<li node="[object Object]">1–5 star rating</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Experience comment</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Review storage in SQLite</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Reviews displayed automatically on the website</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Protection against HTML injection in displayed reviews</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Existing rating display of <strong>4.2 from 451 ratings</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>For a public production website, add review moderation so reviews are approved by the restaurant before appearing publicly.</p></div></div><div class="ChatMessage-module__actions__zluC2" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message tools" data-testid="nonshared-toolbar"><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="medium" data-variant="invisible" aria-labelledby="_r_bt_" tabindex="0"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-thumbsup" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align: text-bottom;"><path d="M8.347.631A.75.75 0 0 1 9.123.26l.238.04a3.25 3.25 0 0 1 2.591 4.098L11.494 6h.665a3.25 3.25 0 0 1 3.118 4.167l-1.135 3.859A2.751 2.751 0 0 1 11.503 16H6.586a3.75 3.75 0 0 1-2.184-.702A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 3 16H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 14.25v-6.5C0 6.784.784 6 1.75 6h3.417a.25.25 0 0 0 .217-.127ZM4.75 13.649l.396.33c.404.337.914.521 1.44.521h4.917a1.25 1.25 0 0 0 1.2-.897l1.135-3.859A1.75 1.75 0 0 0 12.159 7.5H10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.721-.956l.731-2.558a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.127-2.14L6.69 6.611a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.523.889H4.75ZM3.25 7.5h-1.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25H3a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25Z"></path></svg></button><span class="prc-TooltipV2-Tooltip-tLeuB" data-direction="s" data-component="Tooltip" aria-hidden="true" id="_r_bt_" popover="auto">Good response</span><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="medium" data-variant="invisible" aria-labelledby="_r_bv_" tabindex="-1"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-thumbsdown" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align: t