dule__latest__Qoj3r"><div class="CopilotBadgeV2-module__copilotBadge__L5S_M ChatMessage-module__avatar__IiVM1" aria-label="Copilot badge" role="img"><div class="CopilotBadgeV2-module__animation__y97pl CopilotAnimation-module__copilotAnimationHolder__fEoM9" style="--copilot-animation-scale: 1;"><div class="CopilotAnimation-module__copilotAnimation__xGfQ1"><div class="Static-module__static__NqCeO" data-animation-state="idle" aria-hidden="true" style="--copilot-animation-sprite: url(&quot;https://github.githubassets.com/assets/Static-115d0ee3b2baaff0.svg&quot;);"></div></div></div></div><div class="ChatMessage-module__content__haI0H"><div class="js-snippet-clipboard-copy-unpositioned ChatMessage-module__messageArea__mDCMv"><h3 class="sr-only MarkdownRenderer-module__accessibleHeader__pNAp5">Copilot said: Absolutely — below is the complete final</h3><div class="markdown-body MarkdownRenderer-module__container__sJ8jf MarkdownViewer-module__markdownOverrides__sSQCQ copilot-chat-compact-tables" data-copilot-markdown="true" style="--MarkdownRenderer_streaming-fade-duration: 750ms;"><p>Absolutely — below is the complete final project folder you can run locally.</p>
<p>Save these files in a folder named:</p>
<p>3-idiots-garden-cafe/</p>
<p>Then run:</p>
<p>npm install
npm start</p>
<p>Then open:</p>
<p><a href="http://localhost:3000/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">http://localhost:3000</a></p>
<p>This includes:</p>
<ul>
<li node="[object Object]">Restaurant landing page</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Multi-cuisine menu</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Birthday / kitty / small party booking</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Table reservation</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Customer reviews</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Page view counter</li>
<li node="[object Object]">Backend storage</li>
<li node="[object Object]">WhatsApp alert to executives</li>
</ul>
<p>Files:</p>
<ol>
<li node="[object Object]">package.json</li>
<li node="[object Object]">server.js</li>
<li node="[object Object]">public/index.html</li>
<li node="[object Object]">.gitignore</li>
</ol>
<p>Use the file blocks exactly as shown below.</p>
